# Default: ignore everything in .remember/ (ephemeral session buffers)
*

# Track the handoff baton + rolled history so it syncs across machines.
# now.md (active buffer), tmp/, and logs/ stay local to avoid merge churn.
!.gitignore
!remember.md
!today-*.md
!recent.md
!archive.md
!core-memories.md
!open-jobs.md
